From f99cd41222a1a5d2be730bf89de5b9fecb6f9b8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 09:31:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(rocenante): route switchless peers by HCA stripe

Upstream base: 0332cc5089137753d3af43d1c643516b4350359f

Rationale: Prepare per peer HCA routes and key compiled flags by route stripe count.
Quality and speed: Preserves collective values and switchless routing capacity.
Tests: source replay, syntax parse, and diff check; target hardware qualification pending.
Upstream status: local candidate, not submitted.
